{"connection_id": "BC-3db648287f2b2eacb5b1", "ref": "WLC:Jer.50.6", "target": "sec3", "tradition": "tevrat", "kind": "motif", "basis": "shepherds lead sheep astray from their resting place", "note": "The lost sheep are misdirected by their shepherds through the mountains and forget their resting place; this is a pointed negative reversal of the source's guide who brings a flock to pasture."}
