{"connection_id":"BC-e7180975437cc9c5f6bb","ref":"SBLGNT:Rev.7.16","status":"rejected","reason":"End-time absence of hunger and thirst belongs to the redeemed crowd; the verse itself has neither sheep nor grass and is more remote than the selected pasture texts.","paragraphs":[15,16],"evidence":["SBLGNT:Rev.7.16"],"annotations":[]}
{"connection_id":"BC-72467f90ee70e8411822","ref":"SBLGNT:Rev.7.17","status":"rejected","reason":"The Lamb guides the redeemed to living-water springs, an eschatological Christian scene distinct from temporary pasture becoming debris.","paragraphs":[15,16],"evidence":["SBLGNT:Rev.7.17"],"annotations":[]}
{"connection_id":"BC-a3ef6c1c6baaf3a62e1f","ref":"SBLGNT:Rev.7.17","status":"rejected","reason":"The verse truly joins shepherding and guidance, but the destination is eternal springs, whereas paragraph 16 concerns perishable grazing and worldly use.","paragraphs":[16],"evidence":["SBLGNT:Rev.7.17"],"annotations":[]}
{"connection_id":"BC-7d891bb1333cdf843d2f","ref":"Shepherd of Hermas, Vision 5.1–7","status":"unavailable","reason":"The Hermas passage is absent from this local snapshot, so the proposed repentant shepherd figure is not independently verified.","paragraphs":[14],"evidence":[],"annotations":[]}
{"connection_id":"BC-55e3dde8c8b16a97c8fa","ref":"1 Enoch 89:59–90:27","status":"unavailable","reason":"The Animal Apocalypse passage is absent from this local snapshot; the Lord-of-sheep and appointed-shepherds claim remains unchecked.","paragraphs":[14,15],"evidence":[],"annotations":[]}
{"connection_id":"BC-9cdd56f6fb6b5ea5845b","ref":"Exodus Rabbah 2:2","status":"unavailable","reason":"This midrash is absent from the local snapshot; Moses' alleged care for a stray lamb cannot be verified here.","paragraphs":[16],"evidence":[],"annotations":[]}
{"connection_id":"BC-ed2d0763eea3372cf1ab","ref":"Exodus Rabbah 2:2","status":"unavailable","reason":"The cited midrash is absent locally; its specific thirsty-lamb account remains unverified.","paragraphs":[16],"evidence":[],"annotations":[]}
{"connection_id":"BC-a312bc42b657c7f55713","ref":"Psalms of Solomon 17:40–41","status":"unavailable","reason":"This pseudepigraphic passage is absent from the local snapshot; the proposed Davidic shepherd wording is unchecked.","paragraphs":[14,15],"evidence":[],"annotations":[]}
{"connection_id":"BC-6d3741f87bef1c8dbee5","ref":"Sifre Numbers 140","status":"unavailable","reason":"The Sifre passage is absent locally; its exposition of the leader going before Israel cannot be verified.","paragraphs":[16],"evidence":[],"annotations":[]}
